<title>INDIA: Indian exports fell 10.1 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Indian exports fell 10.1 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian merchandise exports fell to $2.52 billion in April, down 10.1 percent from $2.81 billion in the same month in 1996, the government said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE   Apr 97    Mar 97    Apr 96</p>
<p>    Exports		  2.52	3.30	2.81</p>
<p>    Imports		  3.03	3.46	2.98</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -0.51     -0.17     -0.18</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures, in billions of dollars, may not add up due to rounding.</p>
</text>
